-- #1007: remove DB-spawned creatures that duplicate a vehicle's own accessory rider.
-- Vehicles in vehicle_template_accessory / vehicle_accessory spawn their seated rider at runtime; a DB creature of the
-- same entry standing on the vehicle (<= 3 yd, same phase) shows as a second, loose rider.
-- Deleted: 137 pure duplicates (same entry as accessory, same phase as vehicle, no smart_scripts guid / formation /
-- pool / game event / linked_respawn / waypoint reference, and neither SFDB 5.4.8 nor TDB 4.3.4 spawns a rider there).
-- Kept (82 of 219 riders): 68 in a different phase than the vehicle (phased quest vehicles), 2 with a waypoint path
-- (136757, 136760), 2 in a game event (303702, 303703), 10 that SFDB/TDB also spawn
-- (114262,114274,114278,190581,190583,232720,232722,232724,232728,232729).
-- Backup of the deleted rows: (not shipped)
